{
  "GUJI, Aming, GDC, Torturing Nurse, Laurent Lettrée": "GUJI、Aming、GDC、Torturing Nurse、Laurent Lettrée",
  "Geek out and get your freak on over at Cedar Land as LiveChinaMusic invites a motley crew of sound explorers, noise makers, and rabble rousers to stir beautiful chaos in the subterranean oasis of Cedar Land. An excavation of the Shanghai underground scene at its most peculiar, most heedless, and most dangerously alluring - it’s a monster mash of harsh noise, techno grooves, looping sonic vistas, new wave punk, and audiovisual hijinks. Acts include rising synth punks GUJI, musical savant and mischief maker Aming Liang, and analog collector, manipulator, and ‘aggrandizer of disorganization’ Global Discount Centre aka GDC, known for utilizing an array of discarded electrical relics. Plus, French artist, sonic alchemist, and occasional plant whisperer, Laurent Lettrée, and the harbinger of harsh noise legend Torturing Nurse. Expect the unexpected.": "当LiveChinaMusic邀请一群杂乱无章的声音探险家、噪音制造者和乌合之众在Cedar Land的地下绿洲中搅动美丽的混乱时，您可以在Cedar Land上狂欢。这是对上海地下场景最奇特、最不小心、最危险的诱惑的挖掘--它是刺耳的噪音、技术凹槽、循环的声音景观、新浪潮朋克和视听hijinks的怪物混搭……",
  "Pumpkins, 88balaz": "南瓜， 88balaz",
  "Xinxiang punk mainstays Pumpkins have always followed their own arrow throughout their careers - slowly but steadily expanding their sound whilst retaining the grit, charisma, and sincerity that made them so endearing in the first place. A rip-roaring ode to rock and roll in all its mania, allure, and sweaty exuberance - the band is on the road with Taipei rock and roll stalwarts 88balaz - who have been active for 30 years. Punk rock that fuses elements of blues and jazz, the band has become renowned for their explosive live performances, having toured the world over a thousand shows. While they may consider themselves \"the worst band in the entire universe,\" they are punk icons in their own right.": "新乡朋克的中流砥柱南瓜在整个职业生涯中一直跟随自己的箭头-缓慢但稳步地扩展他们的声音，同时保留了他们最初如此可爱的勇气，魅力和真诚。摇滚乐在其狂热、诱惑和汗流浃背的活力中欢呼雀跃，乐队与台北摇滚乐的88balaz一起走在路上，他们已经活跃了30年。融合e的朋克摇滚……",
  "Acid Room, Abstract Abstract": "酸室，抽象",
  "One of the indie scene’s finest new acts, Suzhou noise rockers Acid Room have been crafting evocative rock and roll over the past few years - leaning into their emo and shoegaze sensibilities with combustible rapture. Apt at blurring the lines within their sound, the band are able to weave in and out of different sonic tones - hitting one cathartic release after another whilst unspooling with raw theatricality. The band are on their first nationwide tour and will be hitting up Mosh Space with support from emerging math rock pop smiths Abstract Abstract.": "作为独立场景中最好的新表演之一，苏州噪音摇滚乐队Acid Room在过去几年中一直在制作令人回味的摇滚乐-凭借可燃的狂喜倾向于他们的情绪和注视。乐队能够模糊声音中的线条，能够编入和编出不同的声音音调-一个接一个的宣泄释放，同时以原始的戏剧性展开。乐队正处于他们的第一个国家w……",
  "SPELLLING (US)": "SPELLLING （美国）",
  "Bay Area art-pop visionary Chrystia Cabral, aka SPELLLING, known for pushing the boundaries of genre and captivating audiences with her richly envisioned albums and enchanting live performances, swings through China with her three-piece band courtesy of promoters So Ready. Critically acclaimed for her ability to surprise and mesmerize, she has been on a hot streak since her 2017 debut, Pantheon of Me. Since then, her sound has evolved and woven in elements of avant-folk, dark synth pop, soul music, and even post-punk, building more expansive and hauntingly beautiful soundscapes that never lose their intimacy. She even claimed legendary music blog The Needle Drop's #1 album of the year in 2021. ‘From electronic dirges to orchestral masterpieces, from gothic balladry to mystical surrealism,’ she’s the real deal - a spiritual successor to acts like Björk or Kate Bush.": "湾区艺术流行音乐家Chrystia Cabral ，又名SPELLLING ，以其丰富的专辑和迷人的现场表演突破流派界限并吸引观众而闻名，她的三人乐队由发起人So Ready提供，在中国各地摇摆。她因其惊喜和迷人的能力而备受好评，自2017年首次亮相《我的万神殿》以来，她一直处于热门状态。从那时起，她的声音不断发展和编织，……",
  "ALTER. Pavilion presents: GARDEN OF MISFITS at Yuyuan": "ALTER. PAVILION PRESENTS ：豫园错配花园",
  "Garden of Misfits brings together a group of DJs and friends for a full day and night of dancing at a terraced venue overlooking Yu Garden. DJ sets run from the afternoon into the night, moving from the terrace to an indoor dancefloor until 2am.": "Garden of Misfits将一群DJ和朋友聚集在一起，在俯瞰Yu Garden的露台上整日整夜地跳舞。DJ表演从下午一直持续到晚上，从露台到室内舞池，一直持续到凌晨2点。",
  "Nantong’s Blue Liquid has quietly become one of the hottest new acts in this region - tapping into a 90s alt sound with such riotous affinity whilst finding that sweet spot between noise and pop oh so well. There’s a melodic charge in their eclectic sound that’s infectious, jangly, and potent - a joyous rapture that rubs off on the listener. The band are fresh off their debut LP with Maybe Mars Records and are hitting the road. Their stopover at Yuyintown Basement will be supported by jam psych-pop trio pewf - one of this year’s hottest new acts.": "南通的Blue Liquid已悄然成为该地区最热门的新表演之一-以如此喧闹的亲和力进入90年代的alt声音，同时在噪音和流行音乐之间找到甜蜜点。他们不拘一格的声音充满了旋律，传染性、刺激性和强大性--一种欢乐的狂喜，在听众身上消失。乐队刚刚从Maybe Mars Records的首张专辑中脱颖而出，正在上路。他们的中途停留……",
  "TOOKOO, Twinkle Star, Diels-Alder, MissingWishes": "TOOKOO、Twinkle Star、Diels-Alder、MissingWishes",
  "‘Make emo great again’ has been the sentiment over the past couple of years, as a new generation of kids disillusioned by the world around them have found solace in screaming their guts out. And now the emo revival has come full circle with the release of King-Size China III - the long-awaited return of the emo compilation that first took shape in 2006 and was originally spearheaded by OG Beijing emo act TOOKOO. A robust, eclectic survey of the emo scene today - the organizers are throwing parties across China with a stop in Shanghai. On the bill, they’ve got veteran emo pop-punk favorites Twinkle Star, rising, refined Hefei emo rock slayers Diel-Alder, Beijing pop-punk emo outfit MissingWishes, and the OG emo team themselves - Tookoo - led by twin brothers Li Xiaochuan and Li Xiaoquan, who adhere to the genre’s more tender, heart-arching, and melodically driven acts.": "“让情绪再次伟大”是过去几年的情绪，因为新一代的孩子对他们周围的世界感到失望，他们在尖叫中找到了安慰。现在，随着King-Size China III的发布，情绪复兴已经全面展开--期待已久的情绪汇编回归，该汇编于2006年首次成形，最初由OG北京情绪表演TOOKOO牵头。一项强有力的、兼收并蓄的调查……",
  "VoX LoW (FR)": "低音量（FR）",
  "Cold wave crossed with krautrock - Paris’s Vox Low are an electro outfit that’s been compared to the acid-house version of Jesus & Mary Chain. With a dark and romantic sound with an industrial sheen, monotone vocals that have all the ‘rock and roll attitude of an exhausted 90s raver’, and an intoxicating blend of funereal post-punk, hazy dub, and synth-heavy electro, Vox Low is a vibe and a very good one at that. The French act returns this time to Future House (formerly Bandai Namco).": "与Krautrock交叉的冷浪-巴黎的Vox Low是一款电动服装，与Jesus ＆ Mary Chain的酸性版本进行了比较。Vox Low拥有黑暗浪漫的声音和工业光泽，单调的人声具有所有“精疲力竭的90年代狂欢者的摇滚态度” ，以及令人陶醉的葬礼后朋克，朦胧的配音和合成重电子的混合体， Vox Low是一种氛围，非常好。这次法国的行为又回来了……",
  "Belgian Beer Garden Third Edition": "比利时啤酒花园第三版",
  "This September, the Belgian Beer Garden @ PAC Mall returns to Jing’an for its third and biggest edition yet, running over two weekends on September 4–6 and September 11–13, 2026. Entry is free, with the festival open Friday from 17:00–22:00 and Saturday and Sunday from 12:00–22:00. And this one is getting seriously big.": "今年9月，比利时啤酒花园@ PAC购物中心（ Belgian Beer Garden @ PAC Mall ）重返静安，这是迄今为止第三届也是最大的一届啤酒节，在2026年9月4日至6日和9月11日至13日的两个周末举行。门票免费，电影节开放时间为周五17:00 – 22:00 ，周六和周日12:00 – 22:00。而这一个正变得越来越大。",
  "Imagine Dragons & Coldplay Tribute": "Imagine Dragons和Coldplay Tribute",
  "Throughout history, rivalries have sparked heated battles: Jets vs Sharks, Greasers v. Socs, Rockers vs Mods, Warriors vs every gang in NYC and now, The Pearl is hosting a clash of modern-day musical titans: Imagine Dragons vs Coldplay.": "纵观历史，竞争引发了激烈的战斗：喷气机对鲨鱼，油脂对Socs ，摇滚者对Mods ，勇士对纽约市的每个帮派，现在， The Pearl正在举办一场现代音乐巨头的冲突：想象龙对酷玩乐队。",
  "Youth Palace": "青年宫",
  "Positioned as a temporary “social school,” this summer presentation transforms the museum into a space of ongoing training, where education, performance, and artistic practice overlap through a series of participatory workshops led by more than 40 local and international artists. Rather than presenting works as fixed objects, the project unfolds through physical exercises, craft-based sessions, and collective learning formats—from boxing and textile weaving to experimental group activities and storytelling sessions—inviting visitors to actively engage with ideas of discipline, embodiment, and shared knowledge. Inspired by collective education models such as youth cultural centers, the program reimagines learning as an open-ended process of “training, retraining, and de-training,” where the boundaries between teacher and participant, artwork and classroom, are continuously blurred into a fluid, evolving social practice.": "这个夏季展览被定位为一个临时的“社会学校” ，将博物馆转变为一个持续培训的空间，通过一系列由40多位本地和国际艺术家领导的参与式研讨会，教育、表演和艺术实践相互重叠。该项目不是将作品作为固定对象呈现，而是通过体育锻炼、基于工艺的课程和集体学习形式（从拳击和文本）展开……",
  "90's Alt-Rock Concert": "90年代Alt-Rock音乐会",
  "A 90s alternative rock tribute night at The Pearl, performed by Red Stars Band, revisits the era’s defining sound. The set pulls from bands like Nirvana, Radiohead, Oasis, Foo Fighters, and Green Day, bringing familiar tracks back to the stage. Expect a straightforward live show focused on the music and the energy of the decade.": "由红星乐队（ Red Stars Band ）表演的90年代另类摇滚致敬之夜重温了这个时代的定义声音。这组歌曲来自Nirvana、Radiohead、Oasis、Foo Fighters和Green Day等乐队，将熟悉的曲目带回舞台。期待一场直接的现场表演，重点关注十年的音乐和活力。",
  "The Stage: Shanghai’s Open-Air Skyline Deck": "舞台：上海露天天际甲板",
  "The Stage at Sinar Mas Center offers one of Shanghai’s most breathtaking skyline views. Perched atop the North Bund’s tallest skyscraper, this open-air observation deck gives visitors a rare outdoor vantage point over the Huangpu River, the Bund, and Lujiazui’s iconic towers. At 320 meters high, it’s one of the city’s few platforms without glass barriers, making the experience both unique and unforgettable.": "Sinar Mas中心的舞台提供上海最令人叹为观止的天际线景观之一。这座露天观景台坐落在北外滩最高的摩天大楼上，为游客提供了黄浦江、外滩和陆家嘴标志性塔楼的罕见户外观景点。它高320米，是该市为数不多的没有玻璃屏障的平台之一，让体验变得独特而难忘。",
  "HD Screening: Shakespeare's Globe - Twelfth Night": "高清放映：莎士比亚环球剧场-第十二夜",
  "This is a high-definition screening of Twelfth Night from Shakespeare’s Globe, featuring a full all-male cast production. The recording is directed by Tim Carroll and stars Mark Rylance and Stephen Fry.": "这是莎士比亚环球剧场《第十二夜》的高清放映，以全男性演员阵容为特色。录音由蒂姆·卡罗尔（ Tim Carroll ）执导，由马克·莱兰斯（ Mark Rylance ）和斯蒂芬·弗莱（ Stephen Fry ）主演。",
  "BuddyDog Deals: Training, Boarding, and More": "BuddyDog优惠：培训、寄宿等",
  "BuddyDog has amazing deals to keep your pets happy and healthy! Enjoy 1-on-1 daycare training with group socialization for just 366rmb per session, or opt for the 5+1 package (6 sessions) for 1,990rmb, with transportation included. Dogs can also indulge in a swim and shower for only 220rmb, while cozy boarding starts at 148rmb per night. a 7-night boarding package is available for cats (only 968rmb) and dogs (villa only 2,688rmb) . With plenty of outdoor playtime and top-notch care, your pets are in for a treat. Need transport? One-way rides to the Fengxian location are just 185rmb. Don’t miss out on these fantastic offers to pamper your furry friends!": "BuddyDog提供超值优惠，让您的宠物保持快乐和健康！享受一对一的日托培训，每节课仅需366元人民币，或选择5 +1套餐（ 6节课） ，费用为1,990元人民币，包括交通费。狗也可以享受游泳和淋浴，费用仅为220元人民币，而舒适的登机费用为每晚148元人民币。猫（仅968元人民币）和狗（别墅仅2,688元人民币）提供7晚登机套餐……",
  "Live Concert: Music of the Silk Road · Echoes of the Tang Dynasty": "现场音乐会：丝绸之路的音乐·唐代的回声",
  "This performance explores reconstructed music from ancient China through historically informed performance. Using restored instruments and decoded scores, the concert presents how Tang-era music may have sounded. The show combines research, live performance, and multimedia staging to recreate a historical soundscape.": "这次表演通过历史悠久的表演探索了中国古代音乐的重建。音乐会使用恢复的乐器和解码的乐谱，展示了唐代音乐的声音。该节目结合了研究、现场表演和多媒体舞台表演，重现了历史悠久的音景。",
  "Anoushka Shankar in Concert": "Anoushka Shankar音乐会",
  "Anoushka Shankar makes her Shanghai debut with a concert spanning classical, contemporary, and world music traditions. Joined by an ensemble of acclaimed musicians, she will perform selections from her Chapters trilogy alongside works from across her career, including music inspired by her father Ravi Shankar and collaborations with Norah Jones.": "Anoushka Shankar在上海的首演将带来一场跨越古典、当代和世界音乐传统的音乐会。在众多知名音乐家的伴奏下，她将演唱《章节》三部曲中的选段，以及她职业生涯中的作品，包括受她父亲拉维·尚卡尔启发的音乐，以及与诺拉·琼斯的合作。",
  "Giorgio Morandi: Solo": "乔治·莫兰迪：独奏",
  "China International Import Expo (CIIE) 2026": "2026年中国国际进口博览会",
  "The China International Import Expo will make a return in 2026. This global exposition has some of the biggest companies and industrialists flock to Minhang and Xujing for one of the largest gatherings of the year. The whole world will have eyes on the city for one whole week.": "中国国际进口博览会将于2026年再次举办。这个全球博览会吸引了一些最大的公司和实业家涌向闵行和徐京，参加今年最大的聚会之一。整个星期，全世界都将关注这座城市。",
  "Broadway Original Musical: Kinky Boots": "百老汇原创音乐剧：变态靴子",
  "The Premium gym is offering a special one-time free trial for SmartShanghai members, applicable at selected Pure outlets in Shanghai. The trial is good for one yoga session (valued at 350rmb) or one day of access to the gym.": "高级健身房为SmartShanghai会员提供一次性免费试用，可在上海指定的Pure门店使用。这一尝试可以让你参加一次瑜伽课程（价值350元人民币）或一天的健身房。",
  "Fotografiska General Entrance Ticket": "Fotografiska普通门票",
  "This is a universal entrance ticket for Fotografiska which allows you to enjoy all exhibitions for the day. Tickets are for a single admission only. Fotografiska changes exhibitions periodically, you can check the SmartShanghai listing to learn more about the current exhibitions.": "这是Fotografiska的通用门票，可以让你享受一天的所有展览。门票只限一次入场。Fotografiska定期更换展览，您可以查看SmartShanghai列表以了解更多有关当前展览的信息。",
  "Sunday Brunch at Chez JOJO": "周日在Chez JOJO吃早午餐",
  "Every Sunday, Chez JOJO offers a French-style Weekend brunch semi-buffet. More than 15 main courses prepared by their chef, together with a nice starter and dessert buffet at your choice. Main course includes: Cheese Fondue, grilled whole lamb shoulder, Homemade Boudin Noir, Homemade Andouillette, and Grand BBQ platter.": "每个星期天，Chez JOJO提供法式周末早午餐半自助餐。超过15道主菜由我们的厨师精心准备，还有美味的开胃菜和自助餐供您选择。主菜包括：芝士火锅、烤全羊肩肉、自制黑布丁、自制炖肉片、大烧烤拼盘。",
  "Huangpu River Cruises on Your Own Luxury Yacht": "乘坐豪华游艇游览黄浦江",
  "The Broadway original musical Kinky Boots comes to Shanghai West Bund Theatre in November 2026. Based on a true story, the musical follows a struggling shoe factory owner and a talented performer who work together to create a new business opportunity through a pair of bold red boots.": "百老汇原创音乐剧《变态靴子》将于2026年11月登陆上海西岸剧院。这部音乐剧根据真实故事改编，讲述了一个苦苦挣扎的鞋厂老板和一个才华横溢的表演者通过一双大胆的红色靴子共同创造了一个新的商机。",
  "Opus III, The Industrial Ruins – Contemporary Puppetry & Visual Theatre": "作品三，工业废墟-当代木偶戏和视觉戏剧",
  "French puppetry company Théâtre de la Massue brings Opus III, The Industrial Ruins, the final work in its The World's Edge's Little Theatre trilogy. Combining puppets, mechanical objects, miniature landscapes and moving images, the non-verbal performance takes audiences into a forgotten post-industrial world shaped by the remnants of coal, steel and oil.": "法国木偶剧公司th<s:1> tre de la Massue带来了作品3《工业废墟》，这是该公司“世界边缘”小剧场三部曲的最后一部作品。结合木偶、机械物体、微型景观和动态图像，非语言表演将观众带入一个被遗忘的后工业世界，这个世界是由煤炭、钢铁和石油的残余形成的。"
}